	mes "a long time ago, things were";
	mes "much different.";
	next;
	mes "[Soldier]";
	mes "Supposedly, monsters used to intrude Luoyang all the time! Heh, but that's just a rumor. Still, there are a bunch of rumors going around that I'm curious about...";
	close;
}

